== Problem description ==
User wants to expand storage using the WWAN slot (separate from the larger main storage)
== Solution ==
These three criteria must be met for the storage to work:

# Protocol: The WWAN slot only supports NVMe. Any storage labeled as SATA will not work.
# Size: The slot is the 2242 size. If you have a 2230 size, an adapter to 2242 will work. I use an adapter and the back case presses against the adapter but no issues.
# Key: The slot only supports B keying. So, you can either have a 2242 with B keying or a 2230 with a B+M adapter that increases the size to 2242.